## What it is

The Aiden doesn't move a spout around the way the [xBloom](/coffee/products/xbloom-studio) or [Spiral Luxe](/coffee/products/breville-spiral-luxe) do. Instead it uses a dual shower head and controls the bloom, pulse timing and temperature, which gets it much closer to pour-over than an ordinary drip machine. It comes up in almost every automatic pour-over roundup.

- **Grinder / scale:** neither, so bring your own
- **Capacity:** swappable single-serve and batch baskets, up to 10 cups, with a double-walled carafe
- **Controls:** brew ratio, bloom, pulses and temperature down to the degree, and it can change temperature during the brew. The app lets you save profiles and schedule brews.
- **Certification:** SCA certified (2024)
- **Warranty:** 2 years, 3 if you register it

## Who it's for

People who want pour-over-style control but sometimes need a whole pot, and who already own a good grinder.
